          "question": "e-8742",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Calculate $\\nabla \\cdot (\\mathbf{F}-3\\mathbf{G})$ for the vector fields $\\mathbf F$ and $\\mathbf G,$ where\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{F}=\\left(x^2+y\\right)\\,\\mathbf{i}+ \\left(xy-y^2\\right)\\,\\mathbf{j}, \\quad \\nabla \\cdot \\mathbf{G}=x+y.\n$$",
