          "value": "Given that $\\mathbf F(x,y) = \\left\\langle \\dfrac 1x, xy \\right \\rangle$ and $f(x,y) = \\dfrac 1{x},$ calculate $\\nabla \\cdot (f\\,\\mathbf F).$",
